{"name": "Dynamite Blue", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Welcome to Vierhaven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A future where Jagear \u2014 technology that replaces parts of the body with machinery \u2014 has spread across the world. A single city splits into three uneasy layers: the Air Ground high above, home to the privileged few; the lawless Underground where no light reaches; and the Midground in between, where ordinary people get through one day at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/c33a7b70655397a95a34cd6e5b6b034d.poster.avif?t=1792389559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/c33a7b70655397a95a34cd6e5b6b034d.webm?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/c33a7b70655397a95a34cd6e5b6b034d.mp4?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 Dynamite Blue \u2014 Just Another Day at the Agency</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small private investigation agency in a corner of the Midground, taking any odd job that comes its way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pocket-change cases that spiral into something shaking the city's underbelly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No money, no connections \u2014 but a cheerful crew that always sees a job through</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/eca08361fe079cfc55c5e68338a102ef.poster.avif?t=1792389559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/eca08361fe079cfc55c5e68338a102ef.webm?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/eca08361fe079cfc55c5e68338a102ef.mp4?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 Six-Element Matchups and Guardian Stone Breaks</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A six-element cycle of strengths and weaknesses, where every move can decide the battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guardian Stone Breaks reward clever matchups by turning the tide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategy completed by BP, a shared battle resource your whole team builds together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every team composition makes for a battle of its own</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/4d95231016f7b9dbd5e87898bf67111f.poster.avif?t=1792389559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/4d95231016f7b9dbd5e87898bf67111f.webm?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/4d95231016f7b9dbd5e87898bf67111f.mp4?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25c6 60+ Heroes, Each With a Story to Tell</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 60 unique characters, written and drawn with care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Pocket Story\" \u2014 personal tales that give every hero their own backstory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companions who grow together with your team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/510cf702ff64781f99c7c02aa68634e3.poster.avif?t=1792389559\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/510cf702ff64781f99c7c02aa68634e3.webm?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/extras/510cf702ff64781f99c7c02aa68634e3.mp4?t=1792389559\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A story-driven 2.5D turn-based RPG set in Vierhaven, a cyberpunk city of sky, street, and shadow. Follow 60+ heroes, each with their own story. From the team behind Exos Heroes.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714620/a5a9525f1afa5632d2f5437d9b34df4aaf1cfb46/header.jpg?t=1792389559", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "JRPG", "Party-Based RPG", "Story Rich", "2.5D", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Kosmo's 12", "publishers": "Kosmo's 12", "release_date": "Oct 18, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4714620", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 October 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Ie3QBA07iu4", "first_seen": 1792360800.0, "review_rank": 15}